     COMMENT   dimension, packed into a 4-byte, native-endian u32, for               COMMENT   each interior node in the tree. The splitting dimension               COMMENT   is packed into the low 2 bits, and the splitting location             COMMENT   uses the remaining bits. The left child of a node                     COMMENT   contains data points that lie on the low side of the                  COMMENT   splitting plane, and the right child contains data points             COMMENT   on the high side of the plane.                                        END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             A!j∑
